session_role":"plan","bead_id":"bob-cli-in.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-in[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Finish bob gmail sync and close bob-cli-ii.3[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob gmail sync meets its approved filing, coordination, reporting, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]recovery, alias, and documentation contract with the acceptance [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]coverage the repair tale promised, so bob-cli-ii.3.1 and phase [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob-cli-ii.3 close with verified evidence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gmail_sync_ii3_completion.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/gmail_sync_ii3_completion.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-in[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-in/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Request coordination, failure state, and report counts[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]coordination[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]coordination: make every Gmail read latch auth aborts and give-ups in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one injectable coordinator, turn search and preparation failures into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]body-free failure state without discarding adoption or recovery, account[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the -r budget only for waits, and fix the report's membership snapshot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and warnings, with unit tests for each.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Host-local, idempotent commit and journal recovery[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]recovery[dim] · [dim][/dim]after coordination[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery: move the sync recovery evidence to host-local state, make its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]replay idempotent per event and ownership-checked per path, stop writing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]auxiliary files on runs that save no note, keep in-flight filings from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]being filed twice, and add the temporary-Git-vault recovery tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end acceptance matrix, alias parity, and lint [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]scaffolding[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after recovery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance: add the missing tests/gmail_sync.rs composition coverage, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]including byte-identical sync versus pull in separate fixed-time [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixtures, and remove the stale dead_code allowances left from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command phase.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sync documentation, help, and generated CLI reference[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after acceptance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: correct the route-prefix and missing-label claims, document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync JSON contract, host-local state, and -r semantics, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]watch-only -l 0 example where the generated reference renders it, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pass the docs gates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-in","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-in.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vc